    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-measurement-pass-3-cuc2-pin1-knockout-negative-control-maximum-serration-count-across-both-ablations> a schema:PropertyValue,
