    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Sharon et al. (2002) Nature / Audoly & Boudaoud (2003) PRL Non-Euclidean Edge Buckling Cascades in Ruffled Leaf Margins — Morphometric validation: 90/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L1616-L1785) now returns 15 reference-anchored measurements: the 9 Pass 2 metrics (A_m/lambda_m = 0.1468 vs 0.1461, r_cascade 3.5, edge-amplitude r = 1.0000, K(0) = -0.001091 mm^-2, lambda_loc r = 1.0000, self-similar collapse r = 1.0000, flat-metric negative control, 4-system r_aspect = 0.9992, specimen cascade ratio 4.75) plus 6 developmental ones (WT <g_0> = 0.6059; cin/WT = 2.10; N_ser = 27; knockout control = 0; hierarchy ratio 3.99; ordinal agreement 1.0). Deductions, applied because the new measurements mostly validate against targets that are not independent data: measurement 10's reference g_0 = 0.64 is the Pass 2 mechanical module's own Lactuca value and gamma_0 = 0.0085/h, beta = 0.75 (L828-L829) were tuned to land near it (-3); measurement 11's reference 1.5 is a declared placeholder for '> 1' (L1646), measurement 12's reference 22.5 is the midpoint of a plausibility range [5, 40] (L1656) and measurement 14's reference 3.5 is a cross-module consistency check against r_cascade (L1676) — only measurements 13 and 15 have crisp literature targets (-4); the serration spacing 2.19 mm is set by D_a, T_pin, kappa, mu_a (L812-L816) chosen for robust patterning, so N_ser = 27 is not evidence (-2); the Pass 2 wavelength / penetration r = 1.0000 are by construction (L250) and the reference table's G1-G4 / 9-station values are analytic rather than digitised from Sharon 2002 Fig. 3 (-1 net, partly already priced in v2). Credit: every new measurement states in `reference_source` exactly which of these caveats applies." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "2002-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves.py L1630–L1640: Measurement 10: WT <g_0> = 0.6059 vs target 0.64 — reference_source flags it as the Pass 2 module's own value (self-consistency, not independent) <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/327729c8/2002-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves.py#L1630-L1640>",
            "2002-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves.py L1646–L1646: Measurement 11 reference_value 1.5 is a declared placeholder magnitude for the ordinal statement cin > WT <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/327729c8/2002-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves.py#L1646-L1646>",
            "2002-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves.py L1656–L1656: Measurement 12 reference = midpoint of a broad plausibility range [5, 40], not a digitised serration count <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/327729c8/2002-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves.py#L1656-L1656>",
            "2002-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves.py L1676–L1676: Measurement 14 reference 3.5 is a cross-module consistency check against the mechanical r_cascade, not empirical <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/327729c8/2002-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves.py#L1676-L1676>",
            "2002-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves.py L812–L816: Serration spacing set by D_a, T_pin, kappa, mu_a — chosen for robust patterning, not fitted to data <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/327729c8/2002-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves.py#L812-L816>" ;
        pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-measurement-4-system-taxon-plastic-sheet-edge-aspect-ratio-a-lambda-correlation>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-measurement-audoly-boudaoud-2003-sub-harmonic-cascade-wavelength-ratio-r-cascade-lambda-m-lambda-m-1>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-measurement-brioschi-intrinsic-gaussian-curvature-k-0-at-free-leaf-margin-g-0-0-64-ell-12-mm>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-measurement-flat-euclidean-metric-negative-control-maximum-amplitude-max-a-m-at-g-0-0>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-measurement-inward-distance-local-wavelength-scaling-lambda-loc-x-correlation-across-x-in-0-36-mm>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-measurement-lactuca-sativa-lollo-bionda-specimen-empirical-cascade-frequency-ratio-n-fine-n-coarse-lactuca-sativa-edge-waves-specimen-jpg>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-measurement-multi-generation-edge-amplitude-a-m-0-correlation-across-g1-g4>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-measurement-pass-3-cin-jaw-d-tcp-loss-of-function-over-wild-type-excess-marginal-growth-ratio-g-0-cin-g-0-wt>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-measurement-pass-3-cuc2-pin1-knockout-negative-control-maximum-serration-count-across-both-ablations>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-measurement-pass-3-developmental-genotype-ordinal-phenotype-agreement-fraction-6-literature-checks>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sharon-ripping-leaf-edge-waves-measurement-pass-3-developmental-wild-type-excess-metric-g-0-from-coupled-cin-tcp-auxin-cuc2-growth-pdes>,
